2" width="1.3rem" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M295.6 163.7c-5.1 5-5.1 13.3-.1 18.4l60.8 60.9H124.9c-7.1 0-12.9 5.8-12.9 13s5.8 13 12.9 13h231.3l-60.8 60.9c-5 5.1-4.9 13.3.1 18.4 5.1 5 13.2 5 18.3-.1l82.4-83c1.1-1.2 2-2.5 2.7-4.1.7-1.6 1-3.3 1-5 0-3.4-1.3-6.6-3.7-9.1l-82.4-83c-4.9-5.2-13.1-5.3-18.2-.3z"></path></svg></span></p></a></li><li><a class="related-post-item" href="introduction-to-generative-ai"><h3 class="h3">Introduction To Generative AI</h3><p class="related-post-content">Generative AI (Artificial Intelligence) refers to a class of AI fashions designed to generate new, authentic content, such as text, photographs, tune, and even videos. Unlike traditional AI, which basically makes a speciality of classification, prediction, or automation, generative AI creates novel outputs primarily based on...</p><p class="reading-time"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-clock-o"></i> 9 min read <span class="arrow-position"><svg fill="currentColor" height="1.3rem" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewbox="0 0 512 512" width="1.3rem" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M295.6 163.7c-5.1 5-5.1 13.3-.1 18.4l60.8 60.9H124.9c-7.1 0-12.9 5.8-12.9 13s5.8 13 12.9 13h231.3l-60.8 60.9c-5 5.1-4.9 13.3.1 18.4 5.1 5 13.2 5 18.3-.1l82.4-83c1.1-1.2 2-2.5 2.7-4.1.7-1.6 1-3.3 1-5 0-3.4-1.3-6.6-3.7-9.1l-82.4-83c-4.9-5.2-13.1-5.3-18.2-.3z"></path></svg></span></p></a></li><li><a class="related-post-item" href="artificial-intelligence-in-telecommunication"><h3 class="h3">Artificial Intelligence in Telecommunication</h3><p class="related-post-content">Introduction The telecommunication industry experiences a transformative shift through Artificial Intelligence because it implements improvements in operational efficiency and customer satisfaction and delivers technological breakthroughs. AI systems with artificial intelligence technology enable automatic network management along with resource optimization while system failure prediction ensures both minimal down